msgid "Dev Services for Kogito"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If any Kogito process-related extension is present (e.g. `kogito-quarkus` or "
"`kogito-quarkus-processes`), Dev Services for Kogito automatically starts a "
"Data Index in dev mode.\n"
"So, you don't have to start it manually or have any other service set-up "
"manually.\n"
"The application is configured automatically, meaning that will replicate any\n"
"Kogito messaging events related to Process Instances and User Tasks into the "
"provisioned Data Index instance."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Additionally, xref:dev-ui.adoc[Dev UI] available at http://localhost:8080/q/"
"dev[/q/dev] complements this feature with a Dev UI page which helps to Query "
"Data Index via its GraphQL UI."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For more details about how to query data about processes and user tasks, "
"please visit https://docs.kogito.kie.org/latest/html_single/#ref-data-index-"
"service-queries_kogito-configuring[Kogito Data Index documentation]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Enabling / Disabling Dev Services for Kogito"
msgstr ""

msgid "Dev Services for Kogito is automatically enabled unless:"
msgstr ""

msgid "`quarkus.kogito.devservices.enabled` is set to `false`"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Dev Services for Kogito relies on Docker to start the broker.\n"
"If your environment does not support Docker, you will need to start the "
"broker manually, or connect to an already running Data Index."
msgstr ""

msgid "Shared Data Index"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"In case you would like to share the Data Index instance between applications."
"\n"
"Dev Services for Kogito implements a _service discovery_ mechanism for your "
"multiple Quarkus applications running in _dev_ mode to share a single "
"instance."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you need multiple (shared) Data Index instances, you can configure the "
"`quarkus.kogito.devservices.service-name` attribute and indicate the "
"instance name.\n"
"It looks for a container with the same value, or starts a new one if none "
"can be found.\n"
"The default service name is `kogito-data-index`."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Sharing is enabled by default in dev mode.\n"
"You can disable the sharing with `quarkus.kogito.devservices.shared=false`."
msgstr ""

msgid "Setting the port"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"By default, Dev Services for Kogito starts a Data Index using port 8180.\n"
"You can set the port by configuring the `quarkus.kogito.devservices.port` "
"property."
msgstr ""

msgid "Configuring the image"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Dev Services for Kogito uses: `kiegroup/kogito-data-index-ephemeral` images.\n"
"You can select any version from https://quay.io/repository/kiegroup/kogito-"
"data-index-ephemeral?tab=tags."
msgstr ""

